        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion D5, River Rock Sandcast Bronze Handleset With Covered Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith a simple design, Fusion Hardware's River Rock Handleset is a great way to add a rustic touch to your doors. Nothing specifically about it alludes to the natural elements; but there is an organic ambience to this handleset that makes it feel warmer than traditional bronze door hardware. It is made out of true bronze with over 90 percent copper content. A full plate handleset, it features a covered deadbolt. Available 3 finishes, it will fit all standard 5-1/2 inch on center door borings.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sandcasting</b> is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten Bronze is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the River Rock Collection Bronze Handleset Fusion D5:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>True bronze product (sandcast and lost wax) with over 90% copper content.</li>\r\n<li>Bump resistant cylinder.</li> \r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway and 5 pin system with self lubricating solid brass plug & housing.</li>\r\n<li>High security strike.</li> \r\n<li>Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation<./li>\r\n<li>Matching latch, strike and screws for excellent appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual.</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used.</li>\r\n<li>Dual spring assist to eliminate \"knob wobble\" found in lesser products.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Rustic Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Length: 17-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Bronze.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 5-1/2\" on center door boring.</li>\r\n<li>Center of latch bore to center of bottom thrubolt for handle:  6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>One year finish warranty.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> For looks only. They are non-locking and non-latching. They are used as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the handle underneath the deadbolt is operated by a thumb latch on the outside and either a knob or a lever on the inside.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will match the outside finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "River Rock Sandcast Handleset, Fusion D5",
                "description": "River Rock Covered Deadbolt Handleset Fusion D5 - With a simple design, Fusion Hardware's River Rock Handleset is a great way to add a rustic touch to your doors. Nothing specifically about it alludes to the natural elements; but there is an organic ambience to this handleset that makes it feel warmer than traditional bronze door hardware. It is made out of true bronze with over 90 percent copper content. A full plate handleset, it features a covered deadbolt. Available 3 finishes, it will fit all standard 5-1/2 inch on center door borings.\r\n",
                "keywords": "fusion River Rock Sandcast Bronze Handlesets, Fusion D5, FUS-D5, fusion hardware bronze handlests, rustic door hardware, River Rock handlesets, Fusion River Rock door hardware, single cylinder handlesets, fusion hardware D5 River Rock collection,"
